{"pageProps":{"page":{"ID":1904,"post_author":"9","post_date":"December 11, 2025","post_date_gmt":"2025-12-11 18:46:03","post_title":"November 2025 Product Release","post_status":"publish","comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"open","post_name":"november-2025-product-release","post_modified":"2025-12-12 02:31:15","post_modified_gmt":"2025-12-12 02:31:15","guid":"https://pylon-two.vercel.app/?p=1904","post_type":"post","filter":"raw","url":"https://pylon-two.vercel.app/resources/november-2025-product-release/","preview_type":"image","content_blocks":[{"acf_fc_layout":"text_block","text":"<p>This month’s updates include improved explainability of product and rate eligibility, a dedicated <em>Tasks</em> entry, and a new preferred title company workflow.</p>\n<p>Originators will now be able to more easily manage their task queue, work with their preferred title vendors, and walk borrowers through their product and rate options.</p>\n"},{"acf_fc_layout":"text_block","text":"<h2>Improved product and rate eligibility explainability</h2>\n<p>In the Command Center and via API, users can now view reasons why certain products are ineligible or rates aren’t showing, helping them guide borrowers to their best option.</p>\n<p>What it means for you:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Understand exactly why products or rates are ineligible (e.g., <strong>LTV, DTI, FICO, QM cap constraints</strong>)</li>\n<li>Determine how to adjust applications to <strong>unlock expanded eligibility</strong></li>\n<li>Provide borrowers with <strong>clearer, more confident guidance</strong></li>\n</ul>\n"},{"acf_fc_layout":"asset_block","asset":{"type":[{"acf_fc_layout":"image","image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Explainability.png","alt":"ROI: Pylon vs wholesale lender","width":1992,"height":1212}}]}},{"acf_fc_layout":"text_block","text":"<h2>Enhanced <em>Tasks</em> workflow</h2>\n<p>The Command Center left navigation now includes a dedicated link to the <em>Tasks</em> page, which consolidates both borrower and loan officer tasks into a unified interface. A badge on the <em>Tasks</em> link displays the number of open tasks, making it easier to track task progress and manage queues.</p>\n<p>What it means for you:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Never miss</strong> an open task, and clearly see how many tasks are remaining on a loan</li>\n<li>Know exactly <strong>what’s outstanding</strong> from your borrowers in order to close loans</li>\n<li><strong>See conditions</strong> as soon as they arrive in your loan file</li>\n</ul>\n"},{"acf_fc_layout":"asset_block","asset":{"type":[{"acf_fc_layout":"image","image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Tasks.png","alt":"Blog Post Img Tasks Link","width":1992,"height":1212}}]}},{"acf_fc_layout":"text_block","text":"<h2>Support for preferred title companies</h2>\n<p>Loan officers can now specify the title company they’d like to use for closing costs on a loan file in Command Center.</p>\n<p>What it means for you:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Work with the title companies <strong>you know best</strong></li>\n<li>Gain <strong>direct control</strong> over fee updates</li>\n<li><strong>Easily pull fees</strong> for initial disclosures and loan estimates</li>\n</ul>\n"},{"acf_fc_layout":"asset_block","asset":{"type":[{"acf_fc_layout":"image","image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Title-company.png","alt":"Blog Post Img Preferred Title Company","width":1992,"height":1212}}]}}],"related_heading":"Keep reading","related_button_label":"Read more","categories":[{"id":16,"name":"Releases","slug":"release-notes"}],"author":{"name":"Brett Byron","acf":{"profile_image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Brett.png","alt":"Brett","width":515,"height":417}}},"seo":{"title":"November 2025 Product Release - Pylon","description":"Pylon’s November release makes it easier for originators to work with their preferred title vendors, manage their queue of open tasks, and understand how factors like LTV, DTI, and credit score impact a borrower’s product and rate eligibility.","image":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Blog-Post-Hero-November-Product-Release.png"},"featured_image":{"src":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Blog-Post-Hero-November-Product-Release.png","width":760,"height":460,"alt":"Blog Post Hero November Product Release"}},"options":{"menu":{"nav_items":[{"link":{"title":"Platform","url":"/#","target":""},"has_submenu":true,"submenu_type":[{"acf_fc_layout":"grid","grid_links":[{"remove_asset":false,"asset":{"":null,"type":[{"acf_fc_layout":"image","image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/loader.svg","alt":"loader","width":30,"height":30}}],"add_max_width":false,"max_width":""},"link":{"title":"Decisioning","url":"/decisioning","target":""},"description":"Instant credit evaluations"},{"remove_asset":false,"asset":{"":null,"type":[{"acf_fc_layout":"image","image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/list.svg","alt":"list","width":30,"height":30}}],"add_max_width":false,"max_width":""},"link":{"title":"Compliance","url":"/compliance","target":""},"description":"Always-on risk protection"},{"remove_asset":false,"asset":{"":null,"type":[{"acf_fc_layout":"image","image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/user-focus.svg","alt":"user focus","width":30,"height":30}}],"add_max_width":false,"max_width":""},"link":{"title":"Command Center","url":"/command-center","target":""},"description":"Modern loan officer tooling"},{"remove_asset":false,"asset":{"":null,"type":[{"acf_fc_layout":"image","image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/bar-chart.svg","alt":"bar chart","width":30,"height":30}}],"add_max_width":false,"max_width":""},"link":{"title":"Capital","url":"/capital","target":""},"descript